Zwift Online Account Picker
Unofficial community utility. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Zwift.

Launcher/account-picker helpers were extracted and adapted from the local
launcher additions developed alongside a customized zoffline/zwift-offline
installation. The source project carries GNU AGPL v3.0. This extraction is
distributed under AGPL-3.0-only; the full license is included in LICENSE.

2026-11-15 extraction changes: standalone entry point; per-Windows-user local
data directory; removal of offline-server/mode-switching dependencies; online
hosts-file guard; independent build/test/release scripts and documentation.
No proprietary Zwift game, Microsoft runtime or login session is distributed.
